45 780 Td
(   - Finish executing the current instruction.) Tj
T*
(   - Push the 16-bit Program Counter \(PC\) onto the stack \(low byte first, then high byte\),) Tj
T*
(   incrementing SP by 2.) Tj
T*
(   - Clear the interrupt flag \(for timer overflows and edge-triggered external interrupts\).) Tj
T*
(   - Load the PC with the fixed vector address from the table, vectoring execution to the) Tj
T*
(   Interrupt Service Routine \(ISR\).) Tj
T*
(   - The ISR terminates with the instruction RETI \(Return from Interrupt\). RETI pops the return) Tj
T*
(   address from the stack back into PC and restores the internal interrupt logic to allow) Tj
T*
(   subsequent interrupts.) Tj
T*
